 nxedge.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/BakingCooking-Class.png
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://eadn-wc02-10923896.nxedge.io/wp-content/up
 loads/2025/01/BakingCooking-Class.png
UID:oKkTIsfzPmQs12ti2bDBR
SUMMARY:Cooking and Baking Class – September 2026
DTSTAMP:20260823T033706Z
DTSTART:20260912T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:Cook. Learn. Belong.\nStep into the kitchen and discover the jo
	y of cooking together. This free\, hands-on monthly class invites youth ag
	es 5–22 who are blind or low vision—and their families—to build essential 
	kitchen skills in a welcoming\, confidence-building space. \nLed by our O&
	M/ADL Specialist\, Ruby Cabral\, each session blends practical instruction
	 with real-world techniques\, empowering participants to move safely\, ind
	ependently\, and creatively in the kitchen. Together\, families will prepa
	re simple\, delicious recipes while strengthening skills that extend far b
	eyond the stove. \nClasses take place in the Lighthouse kitchen\, located 
	next to The Lighthouse at 820 Marston Street. \nAll tools and ingredients 
	are provided. No experience required—just curiosity\, connection\, and an 
	appetite to learn. \nThis September\, we’ll be cooking: Pumpkin Snickerdoo
	dle Cookies! \nRegistration is required. Come ready to stir\, explore\, an
	d grow—one meal at a time. \nSign Up Is Now Closed\n\nhttps://houstonlight
	house.org/event/cooking-and-baking-class-september-2026/\n\nFrom Houston L
	ighthouse
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/cooking-and-baking-class-september-
	2026/
LOCATION:The Lighthouse of Houston\, 3602 West Dallas\, Houston\, TX\, 7701
	9\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-lighthouse
CATEGORIES:Houston Lighthouse
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
