SUMMARY:Opening Reception: In the Between and Sprawl
DTSTAMP:20260823T033706Z
DTSTART:20260917T231500Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us Thursday\, September 17\, between 6:15pm to 8pm CST for
	 the opening reception of In the Between\, alongside Sprawl by Venessa Mon
	okian in the HOU gallery. In the Between exhibits the work of Stephanie Sh
	ih\, Ronit Porat\, Ksenia Ivanova\, Gary Burnley\, Luis Javier Maguiña\, a
	nd Brigitte Bourger.\n\nhttps://www.edu.hcponline.org/events/in-the-betwee
	n-sprawl\n\nFrom Houston Center for Photography
